  <item>
    <title>Ep.09 这个行业没故事了？聊聊以太坊、加密市场以及Web3创业</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665ee63e63c334a2fb4b5716</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665ee63e63c334a2fb4b5716</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Jun 2024 10:02:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>前段时间写了一篇关于以太坊基金会的文章，发出来之后挺多朋友都找过来，和大家聊下来发现，所有人都很焦虑。这个行业目前的状态好像是比特币一枝独秀、meme玩家通宵达旦无惧牛熊，然后过去两年一直蛰伏的项目方和VC却在所谓的牛市中焦虑退出问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近一两个月，整个圈子似乎都在meme狂欢中反思，为什么没有新叙事？为什么项目估值那么高？为什么手上的价值币在归零？感觉苦等了两三年，没等来柳暗花明，反而行业比以往更割裂，一地鸡毛。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但我倒觉得，现在叫苦的人越多越好，也算是清洗的一个过程，越是黑暗的时刻，新的机遇越多。闫欣和白鱼都是在Web3创业多年的理想主义兼实力派，这次和他们聊完后，我的信仰又满格了。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主播：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Jack，律动BlockBeats副主编</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>闫欣，Sign Protocol联创</span></p><span></span><p><span>白鱼，SeeDAO联创、Nervos生态负责人</span></p><span></span><h2><span>时间线：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a>Zuzalu前后的以太坊生态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">14:09</a>Balaji的比特币网络国家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1286">21:26</a>从以太坊到比特币的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1682">28:02</a>为什么以太坊生态不To C了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2149">35:49</a>关于以太坊基金会与Solana基金会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2681">44:41</a>币圈变了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3438">57:18</a>公链内卷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3897">1:04:57</a>草根创业时代结束</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4123">1:08:43</a>为什么没叙事了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4195">1:09:55</a>老项目怎么应对内卷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4642">1:17:22</a>DAO现在怎么样了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4960">1:22:40</a>今年最重要的事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关阅读：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《</span><a href="https://www.theblockbeats.info/news/53614" data-url="https://www.theblockbeats.info/news/53614"><span>EF没有梦想</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><h2><span>相关链接：</span></h2><span></span><p><a href="https://www.theblockbeats.info/" data-url="https://www.theblockbeats.info/"><span>律动BlockBeats</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://sign.global/" data-url="https://sign.global/"><span>Sign Protocol</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.nervos.org/" data-url="https://www.nervos.org/"><span>Nervos Network</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luZzNY2j00zT2FJld8Fe60OjOH9b.m4a" length="87605499" type="audio/mp4"/>
