  <item>
    <title>Ep.06 和Thomas Yu聊KNN3｜Web3社交算法的认知论</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62d719a792f0689a31f503e2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62d719a792f0689a31f503e2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Jul 2022 03:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在Web2时代，社交媒体的算法定义了我们与谁是朋友、喜欢什么活动、爱看哪类内容...Benedict Evans在《</span><strong><span>Facebook的NewsFeed之死》</span></strong><span>一文中写道：“所有社交应用程序都在增长，直到你需要一个NewsFeed。所有的NewsFeed都在增长，直到你需要一个算法驱动的NewsFeed。所有算法驱动的NewsFeed都在增长，直到你厌倦了看不到东西/看到错误的东西，并转而使用不那么超负荷的、更小的新应用程序。然后，新应用程序也在增长，直到你需要一个NewsFeed”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在Web3时代，信息比以往还要“爆炸”，却又让人目不暇接。我们发现，即使是在去中心化的世界，人们的社交和信息汲取仍然需要聚合与算法。这是否意味着Web3终究摆脱不了NewFeed的诅咒？本期播客请来了Web3算法图谱协议KNN3创始人Thomas Yu，和我们聊一聊他的Web3算法认识论。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主播：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Jack，律动BlockBeats副主编</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Thomas Yu，KNN3创始人</span></p><span></span><h2><span>时间线：</span></h2><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a>KNN3是什么？</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a>KNN3是如何成型的？</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a>KNN算法</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1573">26:13</a>如何去中心化地定义关系？</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a>KNN3与社交图谱应用异同</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a>Web3团队与Web3公共基础设施的关系</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2890">48:10</a>基于KNN3的有趣应用</span></code></p><span></span><h2><span>相关链接：</span></h2><span></span><p><a href="https://www.theblockbeats.info/" data-url="https://www.theblockbeats.info/"><span>律动BlockBeats</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.knn3.xyz/" data-url="https://www.knn3.xyz/"><span>KNN3</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loBDmFDrMuJE3x2ielnFYXhyDR3e.m4a" length="108226242" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZraW9CbHgzaUNqcEJ1eWZ3M0FTeEpzVHVPeVMucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.05 和Chess聊ShowMe｜Web3应用层是国人的蓝海</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/629c5a9bb32f552f54730c56</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">629c5a9bb32f552f54730c56</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Jun 2022 06:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>ShowMe是当前Web3社交赛道当之无愧的龙头应用，对“NFT Pass”一类的订阅模式有着重要的影响。作为Hogwarts Las打造出的第一款Web3应用，ShowMe的成功不仅给这个志在成为“Web3字节”的团队带来了更强的信心，也为Hogwarts Labs未来的应用构建提供着宝贵的借鉴价值。ShowMe成功的秘密是什么？Web3应用的思路有什么不同？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客请来了Hogwarts CEO、ShowMe创始人Chess，和我们分享自己在互联网行业的经验、打造ShowMe的逻辑，以及对Web3应用层的思考。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主播：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Jack，律动BlockBeats副主编</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Chess，Hogwarts Labs CEO；ShowMe创始人</span></p><span></span><h2><span>时间线：</span></h2><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a>Chess的互联网历程：360时代，硬件产品</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="217">03:37</a>Chess的互联网历程：人人车，O2O市场</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a>Chess的互联网历程：映客直播，用户增长</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a>Web3如何改变生产关系？</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1885">31:25</a>关于Web3应用的思考：需不需要PM？国内团队的优势？中心化与去中心化？</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2827">47:07</a>ShowMe的定位、逻辑以及机制</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3725">01:02:05</a>创作者经济的基础设施</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4408">01:13:28</a>Hogwarts Labs的新应用</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4736">01:18:56</a>Web3与Web2做应用的不同逻辑</span></code></p><span></span><h2><span>相关链接：</span></h2><span></span><p><a href="https://www.theblockbeats.info/" data-url="https://www.theblockbeats.info/"><span>律动BlockBeats</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://showme.fan/" data-url="https://showme.fan/"><span>ShowMe</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltscTHbjHIou8Fgi2m6nKc_KGrSd.m4a" length="154547866" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:37:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZxQTNhMDRTQW9FUnRIWGFmRW9yckVZRHhYX1gucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep.04 和Suji Yan聊Mask Network｜一篇赛博世界的主权宣言</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6284d5da2597a3ddfb46d7a5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6284d5da2597a3ddfb46d7a5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 May 2022 11:17:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在Web3世界，Mask Network早已是耳熟能详的名字。对于用户来说，它是那个让推特瞬间变酷的全能插件；对开发者来说，它是那个GitHub捐款无数的天使投资人。无论是在精神上，还是物质上，Mask都为Web3的发展做出了卓越的贡献。本期播客请来了Mask Network创始人Suji Yan，从自己的传奇经历、Mask的前世今生，到Web3的内容社交、应用基建，谈谈Mask对Web3主权精神的解读和寄望。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主播：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Jack，律动BlockBeats副主编</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Suji Yan，Mask Network创始人</span></p><span></span><h2><span>时间线：</span></h2><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a>Suji和Mask的故事</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="532">08:52</a>Mask的价值观</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a>Mask的发展史</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">23:28</a>Mask的规划图</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a>关于Web3的公共设施与应用“淘金”</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">32:10</a>应用层的“去中心化问题”</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2155">35:55</a>关于Web3的“Social+Fi”</span></code></p><span></span><h2><span>相关链接：</span></h2><span></span><p><a href="https://www.theblockbeats.info/" data-url="https://www.theblockbeats.info/"><span>律动BlockBeats</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mask.io/" data-url="https://mask.io/"><span>Mask Network</span></a></p>]]></description>
