    <title>Ep.03 和刘果、Atlas聊Matters Lab｜Web3的核心是共创精神</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6270b2163e8abf901a68d959</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6270b2163e8abf901a68d959</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 May 2022 04:39:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在Web3概念兴起之前，Matters Lab就已开始探索内容创作者内容所有权及变现渠道的问题和解决方案。作为在应用层深耕的团队，Matters对当前Web3应用爆发的潮流也有自己的思考。本期播客请来了Matters Lab联创刘果、RSS3联创Atlas，一位开拓应用，一位耕耘协议，我们从Matters Lab正在做的事情，聊到了应用与协议的关系，以及整个Web3的淘金热。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主播：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Jack，律动BlockBeats副主编</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>刘果，Matters Lab联创</span></p><span></span><p><span>Atlas，RSS3联创</span></p><span></span><h2><span>时间线：</span></h2><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="281">04:41</a>Matters News的演变史</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="507">08:27</a>Travelogger：Web3的漂流瓶</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">13:42</a>The Space：像素大战，Matters的有趣实验</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a>Matters Lab的共创文化</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a>Web3内容变现的探索</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a>应用的发展需要底层协议的支持</span></code></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2971">49:31</a>关于Web3的淘金热</span></code></p><span></span><h2><span>相关链接：</span></h2><span></span><p><a href="https://www.theblockbeats.info/" data-url="https://www.theblockbeats.info/"><span>律动BlockBeats</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://matters-lab.io/" data-url="https://matters-lab.io/"><span>Matters Lab</span></a></p>]]></description>
