  <item>
    <title>Ep.01 和Joshua聊聊RSS3｜Web3需要一个信息集散地</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62505ee7abceb019a9552658</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62505ee7abceb019a9552658</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Apr 2022 20:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在Web3，内容创作者拥有了自己作品的所有权，但是怎样分发、如何宣传、能否变现还有待解决与完善。在Feed爆炸的Web3时代，我们需要一个数据的集散地和信息的分发渠道。这一期节目我们请到了RSS3联创Joshua，一起聊聊RSS3如何实现Web3的信息分发和内容变现。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主播：</span></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>Jack</span></strong><span>；律动BlockBeats副主编</span></p><span></span><h2><span>嘉宾：</span></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>Joshua</span></strong><span>；RSS3联创</span></p><span></span><h2><span>时间线：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:47</a>RSS3是什么？与RSS有什么区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a>RSS3未来会在Web3扮演什么角色？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a>用户建、算法NewsFeed，以及Social Token</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1746">29:06</a>如何在Web3打造护城河？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2007">33:27</a>RSS3未来的生态发展及主要工作</span></p><span></span><h2><span>相关链接：</span></h2><span></span><p><a href="https://www.theblockbeats.info/" data-url="https://www.theblockbeats.info/"><span>律动BlockBeats</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://rss3.io/" data-url="https://rss3.io/"><span>RSS3</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://cheers.bio/" data-url="https://cheers.bio/"><span>Cheers.bio</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqGpiYOb-6fITdaNUwCjt4f52HMv.m4a" length="41618730" type="audio/mp4"/>
